{"product_id":"l-i-f-e-learning-information-for-everyday-independence-readiness","title":"L.I.F.E. Learning Information For Everyday: Independence Readiness","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"College? Military? Work? I'm so confused!\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\"What should I wear to my job interview?\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\"I'm broke ... again!\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\"I don't know what to do in a car accident.\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThese thoughts are common for adolescents as they prepare for freedom from supervision, seek individuality, and gain self-sufficiency. That is why L.I.F.E. - Independence Readiness allows teenagers to explore their skill and knowledge base related to the final \"adulting\" concepts:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eAfter High School\u003cbr\u003e\nEmployment\u003cbr\u003e\nPersonal Finance\u003cbr\u003e\nTravel\u003cbr\u003e\nThe goal is for teens to be able to answer the questions provided in this book, discuss answers with an adult mentor, and gain confidence as they transition to a self-reliant lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eAs with all the L.I.F.E. books, the text is conversational with easy to use icons. All questions have answers and elaborations with true stories to illustrate key principles!\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Beth Carey \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780996754842 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 314\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45003725734041,"sku":"5RA9780996754842","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/769d3fa7afc1311353f0f634e8a1e5ab.jpg?v=1734023643","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/l-i-f-e-learning-information-for-everyday-independence-readiness","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}